# Only the app goes to git: everything at the top level is ignored except the list below. The folder also keeps
# local-only things that must never be published: another company's app and site saved for design reference
# (itd-xapk, site-mirror, site-audit-itd.md and its *.json maps), screenshots, internal server notes (docs), builds.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/app/
!/design/
!/gradle/
!/build.gradle.kts
!/settings.gradle.kts
!/gradle.properties
!/gradlew
!/gradlew.bat
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!/alo-local.properties.example

# Inside the app: build output and machine files.
/app/build/
/app/release/
*.iml
.DS_Store
*.log
.cxx
.externalNativeBuild
*.apk
*.aab
*.idsig

# Signing and machine secrets, wherever they are.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pem.key
keystore.properties
local.properties
alo-local.properties
google-services.json
